# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Pretty URLs for the early-access page (nice for sales-email links).
# NOTE: target the CLEAN url /waitlist (not /waitlist.html). Pages auto-redirects
# /waitlist.html → /waitlist, so redirecting to /waitlist.html would loop.
/design-partner   /waitlist   302
/early-access     /waitlist   302

# ── Demo page: every casing anyone might have been given ──
# Pages asset paths are CASE-SENSITIVE, and an unmatched path silently serves the
# homepage instead of 404ing — so a link with the wrong capitalisation looks like
# the demo simply vanished. The canonical page is /WIPdemo; these send every
# plausible variant there, including the WIP/MVP mix-up. Sent to investors, so
# they must not break: add a line rather than assume nobody used that spelling.
/WIPDemo          /WIPdemo    302
/WIPDEMO          /WIPdemo    302
/Wipdemo          /WIPdemo    302
/wipdemo          /WIPdemo    302
/wipDemo          /WIPdemo    302
/MVPdemo          /WIPdemo    302
/MVPDemo          /WIPdemo    302
/MVPDEMO          /WIPdemo    302
/Mvpdemo          /WIPdemo    302
/mvpdemo          /WIPdemo    302
/mvpDemo          /WIPdemo    302
/demo             /WIPdemo    302
/Demo             /WIPdemo    302
/DEMO             /WIPdemo    302

